        "description": "Postnatal growth retardation resulting in short stature",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "hypogonadism",
        "description": "Hypogonadotropic hypogonadism or delayed puberty",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of bilateral congenital cataracts, progressive cerebellar ataxia, and intellectual disability",
    "notes": "Genetic confirmation of SIL1 mutations supports diagnosis but is not mandatory."
